      "text": "[6:35PM] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is a bit slow underneath the Oshodi bridge inwards Brown junction after Whig it is better all the way through Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport Bus stop, then a bit slow at Nacional inwards the Ikeja Overpass to Ajayi Farm.\n\nTraffic is also better to Ile-Zik on to Sule and Mangoro as well as to Ashade and Capitol intersections.\n\nOur Men are strategically situated to ensure free flowing traffic.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
